# A handlebar moustache under the beak (the upper beak plays the nose): a bar along the mouth
# line, both ends twirled up. Anchor: the eye; the moustache starts one pixel right of it and
# hangs from the eye's bottom row down past the jaw.
name: moustache
size: 13x5
anchor: face 0 0
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  M #5a3620
  L #8c5a34

@frame moustache
..K.......K..
.KMK.....KMK.
.KMMKKKKKKMMK
..KMMLMMLMMK.
...KKKKKKKK..
